+Each renderer boot or reload requests the Host's current index injections over correlated Node IPC, with a ten-second deadline. Rebuilt client bundles therefore use their current revisions. A failed read or a Host replacement during the request rejects boot; the shell never falls back to the startup injection table. Module revision and renderer-source checks remain enforced.
